<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0557_T22FS0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Real talk, a homie you just recruited\nweak as hell.\rBut you put in the work and it come\nup. Like me. I was weak too. Still am.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0557_T22FS0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Homies can HOLD stuff like Hennessy\nor Pepto. But they can’t OPEN it.\fNo thumbs. It’s tragic.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0557_T22FS0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Long time no see, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\nI been waitin’ on you.\fThis from Professor Elm.\rThing is... we need you to\nwatch an Egg for us! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0557_T22FS0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Long time no see, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\nI been waitin’ on you.\fThis from Professor Elm.\rThing is... we need you to\nwatch an Egg for us! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0557_T22FS0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got\nthe Egg from the assistant!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0557_T22FS0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">After you left, Elm got a phone\ncall. I don’t know who it was.\rThen Elm just yelled out,\n“Ain’t nobody better for this than\f{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!” Outta nowhere.\rThen he made me bring you\nthis Egg.\rSo here I’m. Deliverin’ eggs.\nFor minimum wage.\rApparently it only hatch if you\nkeep it in your crew.\fThat’s another reason we picked\fyou, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\rTake care of it, for real!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0557_T22FS0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">After you left, Elm got a phone\ncall. I don’t know who it was.\rThen Elm just yelled out,\n“Ain’t nobody better for this than\f{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!” Outta nowhere.\rThen he made me bring you\nthis Egg.\rSo here I’m. Deliverin’ eggs.\nFor minimum wage.\rApparently it only hatch if you\nkeep it in your crew.\fThat’s another reason we picked\fyou, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\rTake care of it, for real!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0557_T22FS0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your crew full.\nYou can’t take the Egg yet.\fI’ll wait. I get paid hourly.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0557_T22FS0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What?\nYou said NO?!\fYou playin’, right?\rProfessor Elm REALLY want you\nto watch it...\n\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0557_T22FS0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0},\nyou takin’ this Egg or what? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0557_T22FS0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0},\nyou takin’ this Egg or what? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
</body>
